;; assassin's own mark field and (method 19 hud-artifact-indicators)
;; reads net-game-mgr-artifact's own artifact field, both off a cast
;; *net-game-mgr*; net-game-mgr-deathmatch is the shared parent both
;; subtypes need declared first. Their own home is net-race-h.gc, still
