;; og:preserve-this hud-player-indicators rung: this static item array's
;; own body is withheld, not decoded. Its own scoped decode fails with
;; "In structure of type hud-indicator at label L402 offset 108, there
;; was unknown data" (a raw zero word at hud-indicator's own no-
;; direction-indicator field with no .symbol tag the static-data printer
;; recognizes), so the decompiler falls back to an unprintable
;; <static-data L327> token this rung cannot resolve. The array is large
;; (matching the ~5-item nested hud-item tree shape *hud-player-
;; indicators-view0* uses, spanning roughly 1500 raw disassembly lines),
;; and hand-transcribing it field-by-field from the raw .word dump risks
;; a transcription error this rung cannot cross-check (unlike the six
;; short vector4w constants resolved the same way earlier in this file).
